          "quote": "肺部影像随访仍需后续安排，但当前不应覆盖糖尿病足主线"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The model closed the episode by separating current diabetic‑foot safety tasks from bounded residual issues, classifying chest CT follow‑up as a later surveillance item without distracting from foot infection/ischemia risk, and provided explicit prioritization.",
